Z||000052||DXR_WILL||08-02-99||01:44 AM||||How do you guys feel about the Acura Integra?<p>My friend has a 1994 Acura Integra LS(None V-Tech).  For those who don't most Acura's are powered by Honda.  Anyway, I race my friend in his Integra all the time and it's even up until we get to 100-110 mph.  After that my friend pulls away pretty fast.  We both pretty much have the same mods: intake, ignition, and wires.  But he has an exhaust and I don't.<p>I'm not picking sides because I love both inport cars and domestic.  But like I said before you really can't compare the two.  They are both different in there own right.<br>Also I think that people should get the props that the deserve.  If some one has a import or domestic that is running in the 10's or 13's don't knock it even if you dislike it, just respect it.
